s-most-wanted-fraudsters-list-after-fleeing-from-united-states/articleshow/133829681.cms", "summary": "Tech CEO Bernhard Fritsch has achieved infamy by landing a spot on the FBI's Most Wanted Fraudsters list after his conviction for investment fraud. Sentenced to fifteen years in prison and required to make restitution, he managed to evade authorities post-arrest in Mexico by escaping to Germany. The FBI is now urgently seeking tips that could lead to his recapture and subsequent conviction.", "published_at": "2026-09-06T07:33:40+00:00", "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/thumb/msid-133829796,width-1280,height-720,resizemode-6,overlay-toi_sw,pt-32,y_pad-600/photo.jpg", "source": {"name": "The Times of India", "tier": "international", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 11, "opinion_fact": 5, "factual_rigor": 75, "framing": 28, "confidence": 0.7, "rationale": {"lean": {"keyword_score": 50.0, "framing_shift": 0.0, "entity_shift": 0.0, "sentence_direction": 0.0, "text_score": 50.0, "source_baseline": 50, "text_shift": 0.0, "delta_max": 24, "confidence": 1.0, "top_left_keywords": [], "top_right_keywords": [], "framing_phrases_found": [], "entity_sentiments": {}, "state_affiliated": false, "unscored": true}, "sensationalism": {"headline_score": 5.0, "body_score": 4.5, "clickbait_signals": 0, "superlative_density": 0.0, "urgency_density": 0.0, "hyperbole_density": 0.0, "measured_density": 0.53, "partisan_attack_density": 0.0}, "opinion": {"pronoun_score": 0.0, "subjectivity_score": 25.9, "modal_score": 0.0, "hedging_score": 0.0, "attribution_score": 0.0, "metadata_score": 0.0, "value_judgment_score": 0.0, "absolutist_assertion_score": 0.0, "classification": "Reporting", "dominant_signals": ["subjectivity"]}, "coverage": {"named_sources_count": 3, "org_citations_count": 11, "data_points_count": 14, "direct_quotes_count": 4, "vague_sources_count": 0, "specificity_ratio": 1.0}, "framing": {"connotation_